---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Building IT"
  description="Building IT's terms of service, including acceptable use, service terms, limitation of liability, and our SMS/text messaging program terms."
  noindex
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main">
    <section class="legal-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {SITE.legalUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap legal-content">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the website and services offered by
          {SITE.name} ("Company," "we," "us," or "our"), a business based in Kankakee, Illinois. By accessing
          our website, submitting a form, or engaging our services, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
          If you do not agree, please do not use our website or services.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Description of Services</h2>
        <p>
          Company provides a managed website service for local service businesses: designing and
          building a website, hosting it, maintaining it, and handling ongoing technical work —
          domains, DNS, SSL, forms, and content updates — for a flat monthly fee. The specific scope
          of any engagement is governed by the plan and details agreed to when you sign up, which
          controls in the event of any conflict with these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>When using our website or services, you agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Violate any applicable law or regulation;</li>
          <li>
            Interfere with or disrupt the security or performance of our website, network, or
            systems;
          </li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any account, system, or data; or</li>
          <li>Use our website or services to transmit unlawful, harmful, or infringing content.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Text Messaging Program Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By providing your mobile phone number and opting in — whether through our website contact
          form, over the phone, or in a signed service agreement — you agree to receive text
          messages from Company related to appointment reminders, project updates, website launch
          notifications, billing/account notices, and other service-related communications. Consent
          to receive text messages is not a condition of purchasing any service.
        </p>
        <div class="legal-callout">
          <p>Text Messaging Terms:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Message frequency varies based on your account and project activity.</li>
            <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
            <li>
              Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to opt out of receiving text messages from us.
            </li>
            <li>
              Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or contact us at
              <a href={SITE.phoneHref}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a> or
              <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
            </li>
            <li>
              Carriers, including wireless carriers, are not liable for delayed or undelivered
              messages.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong
                >Mobile information and SMS opt-in consent are not sold or shared with third parties
                for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong
              > This information is used solely to deliver the text messaging program described above.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on our website — including text, graphics, logos, and software — is owned by
          or licensed to Company and is protected by intellectual property laws. You may not copy,
          reproduce, or distribute our content without prior written permission, except as necessary
          to use our website for its intended purpose. Business content, branding, and photos you
          provide for your own website remain yours.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>
          Our website and its content are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of
          any kind, express or implied, including warranties of merchantability, fitness for a
          particular purpose, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that our website will be
          uninterrupted, secure, or error-free.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Company will not be liable for any indirect,
          incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits, revenue,
          data, or business opportunity, arising from your use of our website or services, even if
          we have been advised of the possibility of such damages. Our total liability arising from
          your use of our website or services is limited to the amount you paid us in the three (3)
          months preceding the event giving rise to the claim.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to indemnify and hold Company, its officers, employees, and agents harmless from
          any claims, damages, losses, or expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees) arising
          from your misuse of our website or services or your violation of these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may reference or link to third-party websites, tools, or services. We do not
          control and are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of any third
          party.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Illinois, without regard to its
          conflict-of-law principles. Any dispute arising from these Terms or your use of our
          website or services will be resolved in the state or federal courts located in Kankakee
          County, Illinois.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Termination</h2>
        <p>
          We may suspend or terminate your access to our website at any time, without notice, for
          conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users, us, or third
          parties. Termination of an active managed website service is handled according to the plan
          details agreed to when you signed up.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an
          updated effective date. Your continued use of our website or services after changes are
          posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at:</p>
        <p>
          <strong>{SITE.name}</strong><br />
          {SITE.location}<br />
          Phone: <a href={SITE.phoneHref}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a><br />
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
